      "context": "They say history is in the past. Today, it has a new future. 🇪🇬✨\nWelcome, world, to the Grand Egyptian Museum!\nAfter years of waiting, the greatest collection of ancient history ever assembled is finally on display. From Tut’s treasures to artifacts unseen by the public, the GEM is a masterpiece of art, architecture, and storytelling.\nAt @soonaboosh, our mission is to find inspiration in these powerful legacies. Today, our inspiration is overflowing.\nWhat’s the first treasure you would run to see?\nShare this post to celebrate this historic moment, and follow @soonaboosh and @e3terafat.setat for a daily dose of beauty and inspiration.#grandegyptianmuseum #gemopening #المتحف_المصري_الكبير #travelegypt #pharoah #kingtut #soonaboosh #egyptianamerican",
